WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.810
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:32.230
It’s time for the KC Grand Prix finals!

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.280
Leon and Sieg were supposed to duel.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:39.940
But Kaiba suddenly arrived and disqualified Sieg!

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:44.470
Instead of the finals, Kaiba will duel instead!

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:48.650
As Kaiba's rival, Sieg attacks him.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.740
What’ll happen in this duel?

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:58.900
Valkyrie vs Blue-Eyes White Dragon

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:08.300
Kaiba, the Valkyries’ curse has only begun.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:13.240
Due to Nibelung's Ring’s effect, you draw two cards.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:19.180
If you draw a monster card, you must send one to the graveyard.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:21.700
I don’t believe in curses.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.400
I didn’t draw a monster card!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.220
I set one card and end my turn!

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:40.840
But due to Nibelung's Ring’s effect, you can't control XYZ-Dragon Cannon.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.270
He'll be attacked directly again.

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:45.890
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.280
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:51.220
Valkyrie Zweite attacks you directly!

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.380
I flip over my set card!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.930
Attack Guidance Armor!

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:04.210
The attack is redirected to the monster wearing that armor!

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.330
I flip over my set card!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.800
Wotan's Judgment!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.240
This card activates when your monster attacks.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:24.620
By exchanging a spell card in my hand with the top card in my deck, I end the Battle Phase.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.560
You with your cheap tricks.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:35.490
But that allowed me to control destiny and gather my three goddess sisters.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:39.100
Witness my Continuous Spells!

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.840
Goddess Urd's Verdict!

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:44.350
Goddess Verdande's Guidance!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.540
Goddess Skuld's Oracle!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.550
The three goddess sisters have appeared!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:53.760
That’s the monster-sealing combo he used to punish Jonouchi!

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.850
A sneaky strategy where you look at my hand.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.960
A strategy a rat would use.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.740
You’re wrong.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:07.210
Since destiny loves me, I can hear her whispers.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.300
Goddess Skuld, who controls the future!

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.580
Show me what's to come!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.870
Three Blue-Eyes White Dragons?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.880
Why are you pale?

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.800
Did you see your defeat?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.840
I choose not to alter your deck!

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:35.420
With Goddess Verdande's Guidance, I can see the present!

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.140
I'll guess your top card.

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.850
It’s a monster card!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.950
If I’m correct, you must summon it facedown in defense position.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.400
What a joke.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:55.480
Then Goddess Urd, who controls the past, will judge that card!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:59.280
If I’m correct, that card is removed from play.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:04.220
Go to Valhalla, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.060
Blue-Eyes...

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.100
...vanished!

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.040
I end my turn.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:24.460
Kaiba, your drawing skills will punish you instead.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:27.760
Of the two Blue-Eyes you'll draw next...

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.790
...Nibelung's Ring will send one to the graveyard.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:39.290
And Erste will gain attack points equal to the Blue-Eyes in your graveyard.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.990
If Erste and Fortune Chariot’s attacks succeed, it's over.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.940
My turn!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.220
I draw!

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.580
Kaiba, I know what you drew!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:57.470
Due to Nibelung's Ring's effect, send the monster card you drew to the graveyard!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.360
Now if he declares the end of his turn, I win.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:07.290
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn from my hand!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.440
What?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.620
Resurrect from my graveyard!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.520
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.880
You did it, big brother!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.990
It's finally here!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:23.630
I won’t let you manipulate my Blue-Eyes!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.460
Blue-Eyes attacks Valkyrie Zweite!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:30.110
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:38.920
By sacrificing Fortune Chariot, Valkyrie Zweite avoids destruction!

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:43.360
How’s that!  Now their life points are equal!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.800
I end my turn!

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.440
Destiny whispers to you?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.890
Blue-Eyes’s roar drowns it out!

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.870
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:57.180
I activate my three goddess sisters' effects!

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:05.140
Place the third card on top.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:10.310
That card is a monster card!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:12.680
Vanish, Luster Dragon #2!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:23.680
I activate the spell card, Gryphon's Feather Duster from my hand!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:30.140
It destroys all spell and trap cards on my field.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:34.560
For every card I destroy, I regain 500 life points.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.180
Blue-Eyes's damage is healed up.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:44.620
I tribute Valkyrie Erste and Valkyrie Zweite!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:52.340
To summon Valkyrie Brunhilde in defense position.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.400
I end my turn.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.260
Sorry to take the fun out of guessing what card you'll draw next...

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:07.640
...but one of them is a monster card.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:10.220
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.860
Nibelung's Ring’s effect activates.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.800
Send the monster card to the graveyard!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.980
As long as I have one Blue-Eyes, that’s enough.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.440
Go, Blue-Eyes!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.460
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.940
Brunhilde’s effect activates.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:45.420
By lowering its defense points by 1000, it's not destroyed in battle.

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:49.740
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:52.040
Too bad, Kaiba.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:56.680
But if I drop its defense points to 0, it can no longer use that effect.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.120
I know that.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.920
My turn.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:01.900
I draw!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:05.160
I switch Valkyrie Brunhilde to attack position!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:13.750
Brunhilde gains 300 attack points for every Dragon on the field!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:21.730
I activate the Equip Spell, Enchanted Sword Nothung from my hand!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:35.110
When it's equipped with this sword, all Dragons on your field are removed from play.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.970
Blue-Eyes is gone in an instant!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:43.930
Big brother!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:48.730
And the equipped monster gains 400 attack points.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.980
And Nothung can do more.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:58.810
It destroys all Dragons it battles, and I take no damage.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:02.000
This sword is a dragonslayer!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:07.450
I activate the spell card, Pegasus Wing from my hand!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:13.900
I can activate this card when Fortune Chariot is in my graveyard.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:21.840
By halving my Valkyrie's attack points, it can attack you directly!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:29.150
But you know what my set card is!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:34.110
But I can still shave 550 of your life points.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.360
Go, Brunhilde!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.690
Attack him directly!

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.620
I flip over my set card, Shrink!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.510
I don’t care!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:54.700
Big brother!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.560
The epilogue is near.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.660
How long I’ve waited for this moment.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.670
Since the day I met you.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:30.800
On that day, you infiltrated my memories, never to vanish.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:35.960
Your father, Gozaburo Kaiba, was still the company president.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:41.520
In the weapons industry, Schroeder Company played second fiddle to your company.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:45.740
It was humiliating for my father.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:52.880
The Schroeders are nobility, so we're not allowed to lose in business.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:59.730
As the successor, I was groomed to crush Kaiba Corporation-

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:03.180
Actually, crush Kaiba Corporation’s successor, Seto Kaiba.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:07.980
I was taught to surpass and crush you.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:14.360
But as my father’s rivalry towards Kaiba Corporation grew...

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:18.750
...Schroeder Company's business grew worse.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.520
Overcome with shock and anxiety, my father quit.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.780
My father was president in name only.

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:30.720
I had to run Schroeder Company.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:35.700
The first thing I did was quit the weapons industry.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:39.600
And enter the game entertainment industry.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:44.700
I was no longer obsessed with Kaiba Corporation, avoiding self-destruction.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.140
However...

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:51.370
Mr. Siegfried, Kaiba Corporation just made an announcement.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:57.640
The new president Seto Kaiba shut down their weapons department...

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:01.090
...and switched to the game entertainment business.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.960
What?

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:12.110
I felt your shadow coming for me, so I immersed myself in game development.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:20.480
I created a landmark invention that would revolutionize Duel Monsters.

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.170
However...

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.540
I was too late.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:32.840
You got the patent for Solid Vision by the slimmest of margins.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.090
I didn’t know that.

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:41.030
But by coming here, destiny finally smiles upon me.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:44.030
Kaiba Corporation's stock is falling.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:48.080
You've lost the peoples' trust.  So if I defeat you now...

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:53.720
...Pegasus will abandon you and choose Schroeder Company as his new partner.

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.150
Is that your goal?

00:13:56.780 --> 00:14:03.580
You initiated this fight and put Kaiba Corporation's fate at risk!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.020
So what?

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.450
W-What?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:15.320
You seem to care a lot about our connection, but I don't care at all!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:20.060
Your worthless words don't affect me at all!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:21.740
Kaiba...

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:26.670
I’ll show that I'm a far greater duelist than you!

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.320
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:32.420
I drew no monster cards.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:37.340
I activate the spell card, Graceful Charity from my hand!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:42.760
I draw three cards from my deck and discard two from my hand!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:47.690
Nice!  If he drew any monster cards this way, he doesn’t have to discard them!

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.170
Kaiba is starting his counterattack.

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:55.070
I discard these two cards.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.740
You're discarding Blue-Eyes?

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:03.110
Then I remove Blue-Eyes and Pitch-Dark Dragon in my graveyard from play!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:08.000
That lets me summon Chaos Emperor Dragon - Envoy of the End in attack position!

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.720
That’s pointless!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.360
Enchanted Sword Nothung can slay any dragon!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:24.530
Chaos Emperor Dragon’s effect sends all cards in our hands and fields to the graveyard.

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:30.540
But you need to pay 1000 life points to use that effect.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.040
And your life points are-

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.780
I set one card!

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:40.600
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Emergency Provisions from my hand!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:46.590
By sending one spell or trap card on my field to the graveyard, I gain 1000 life points!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.930
What?

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:56.930
I pay 1000 life points to activate Chaos Emperor Dragon’s effect!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.970
Destroy everything!

00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:02.080
Cemetery of Fire!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:20.760
For every card that was sent to the graveyard, you take 300 points of damage!

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:26.270
You can no longer hear destiny's whispers.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:29.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.000
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:36.550
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:40.640
I activate the Continuous Spell, Magical Alms from my hand!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:45.270
When it activates, I regain 1000 life points.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:51.440
And every turn, we declare how many spell cards we’re going to use.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.760
We both gain 500 life points per card!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:17:00.710
But if you play fewer cards than you declare, you take 1000 points of damage.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.120
I declare one card!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:10.610
I activate the spell card, Final Light from my hand!

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:16.740
I pay 1000 life points to Special Summon a Light monster from my graveyard!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.520
Resurrect, Brunhilde!

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:27.960
You can also Special Summon a monster with 2000 or lower attack points from the graveyard in attack position.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:32.340
Then I'll Special Summon Cave Dragon!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:39.580
Due to Brunhilde’s effect, she gains 300 attack points for every Dragon!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:44.840
Valkyrie Brunhilde attacks Cave Dragon!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.550
I’ve turned the tables, Kaiba.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.940
I end my turn.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.480
My turn.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.940
I draw!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.160
I declare that I'll use four spell cards!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.240
What?

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:07.340
You only have one card in your hand, but you declare four?

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.490
That’s right.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.870
I'll end you with those four cards.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.200
You think you can draw that many?

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.680
The first card!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:20.770
I activate Card of Demise from my hand!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.780
I draw until I have five cards in my hand.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:26.660
Five turns later, I send my entire hand to the graveyard!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:27.820
What?

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.820
The second card!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:35.020
I activate the spell card, Soul Release from my hand!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:39.790
I select up to five cards from our graveyards and remove them from play!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:43.430
I remove Chaos Emperor Dragon in my graveyard from play!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.870
The third card!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.180
I activate Spell Reproduction from my hand!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:55.470
I discard two spell cards to add one spell card in my graveyard to my hand!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:59.340
The fourth card!

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:04.630
I pay 2000 life points to activate Dimension Fusion from my hand!

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:12.450
We Special Summon as many monsters that were removed from play as possible!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.770
You fool!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.700
Brunhilde gains attack points for every Dragon!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.860
None of your dragons can survive Brunhilde’s attack points-

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.720
Luster Dragon #2 attacks Brunhilde!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.900
He's down to 50 life points!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:51.630
Big brother...

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.070
Have you lost your mind, Kaiba!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:00.180
Since there are fewer dragons, Brunhilde lost attack points.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.680
Chaos Emperor Dragon attacks Brunhilde!

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:16.630
Instead of both being destroyed, Brunhilde avoids destruction by lowering its defense points by 1000.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:23.100
Blue-Eyes White Dragon attacks Brunhilde!

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:26.110
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:40.730
Brunhilde can't use its effect anymore!

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.850
Blue-Eyes White Dragon attacks Brunhilde!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:48.050
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:55.050
M-My Valkyrie...

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.960
My final Blue-Eyes!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:01.720
Let that failed aristocrat hear his requiem!

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.880
Attack him directly!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.810
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.390
How dare you...

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.390
A rat is still a rat.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:31.060
And a rat can't defeat me - the king of beasts!

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:37.500
You did it, big brother!

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:39.940
Wow.

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:14.090
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:29.810
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:35.650
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:44.220
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:49.860
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:58.330
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:04.140
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:12.280
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:15.540
In a duel

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:33.330
Sieg tried to ruin the KC Grand Prix, but Kaiba defeated him mercilessly.

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:36.000
Impressive... is what I want to say.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.660
But when I hear his mocking laughter, I feel bad for Sieg.

